I stand in the hallway.
I am going shopping now.
I need bags for the shopping.
Two cloth bags are hanging on the door.
I take the bags.
They are big and sturdy.
The supermarket does not have free bags.
I do not want to buy a plastic bag.
I do not like plastic bags.
The way to the supermarket is not short.
I am buying a lot of food today.
The shopping is heavy.
I want to carry the food comfortably.
I open the door.
I leave the flat.
